  "question": {
    "text": "One mole of a monoatomic real gas satisfied the equation <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math> where b is a constant. The relationship of interatomic potential V(r) and interatomic distance r for the gas is given by"
